Prove (the `poisson-prove` package)
https://github.com/poisson-labs/prove
First party: Poisson Labs. Distributed on PyPI as the poisson-prove distribution and a
declared dependency of this package, pinned to one exact version in pyproject.toml. Poisson
Break stores its runs through Prove and uses Prove's correction across candidates; it copies
none of Prove's code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Trace (the `poisson-trace` package)
https://github.com/poisson-labs/trace
First party: Poisson Labs. Break calls Trace's command and reads its JSON; it copies none of
Trace's code. Trace is not yet on PyPI, so it is not yet declared in pyproject.toml; it is
declared, pinned to one exact version, the day it is published.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This package uses the Python standard library and no other third-party package directly. The
packages Prove installs (NumPy, pandas, pyarrow, SciPy, Rich, Textual, threadpoolctl) are
Prove's dependencies and are documented in Prove's own NOTICE.
